sequenceDiagram
    actor Researcher
    participant UI as Packs screen
    participant Resolver as Model source resolver
    participant Model as Model manager
    participant API as External artifact API
    participant Download as File download service
    participant Pack as Pack download service
    participant Validate as Pack validator
    participant Store as Wildlife store

    Researcher->>UI: Select Download Latest Pack or Update to Latest Pack
    UI->>Resolver: Resolve latest model metadata
    Resolver->>API: GET latest model
    API-->>Resolver: Version, size, SHA-256, download URL
    alt Installed model is current
        UI->>UI: Retain active model candidate
    else Installed model is not current
        UI->>Model: Prepare model candidate
        Model->>Download: Download to staging and verify
        alt Model preparation succeeds
            Download-->>Model: Verified candidate file
            Model-->>UI: Ready model candidate (not active)
        else Model preparation fails
            Download-->>Model: Failure
            Model-->>UI: Missing or corrupt candidate
            UI-->>Researcher: Update failed and active artifacts remain unchanged
        end
    end
    opt Ready current or prepared model exists
        UI->>Pack: Acquire latest project pack with model candidate
        Pack->>API: GET latest pack
        API-->>Pack: Version, size, SHA-256, counts, download URL
        alt Latest ready version is already installed and compatible
            Pack->>Store: Persist prepared model with current pack if needed
            Pack-->>UI: Keep current pack
        else New version is available
            Pack->>Download: Download ZIP to staging and verify
            Pack->>Pack: Extract into versioned SHA-256 path
            Pack->>Validate: Validate manifest, files, index, and vectors
            alt Candidate is valid and model-compatible
                Validate-->>Pack: Valid manifest
                Pack->>Store: Persist model and pack together
                Note over Pack,Store: Prior records restored if persistence fails
                Note over Pack,Store: Prior directory retained for recovery
            else Candidate is invalid or incompatible
                Validate-->>Pack: Validation errors
                Pack->>Pack: Remove candidate only
                Note over Pack,Store: Active artifacts remain unchanged
                Pack-->>UI: Installation failed
            end
        end
    end